- Corne J, Kumaran M. Chest X-Ray Made Easy, latest edition.
- Royal College of Radiologists / NHS Improvement. Patient safety alert: Nasogastric tube misplacement — confirmation of position.
- Light RW. Pleural Diseases, latest edition (radiological detection of effusions).
- WHO Consolidated Guidelines on Tuberculosis: Module 2 — Screening, 2021 (role of CXR).
